{"id": 8069, "doi": "10.4038/slja.v23i2.8069", "title": "A cobra bite - uncommon bitten site", "abstract": "A 58yrs old female patient presented with a history of cobra bite to right side of the face just below the eye. She was initially resuscitated with endotracheal intubation due to respiratory failure and was administered 20 vials of antivenom serum (AVS). She died on 9th day at intensive care unit. This is an unusual presentation because 1) the bitten site was the face, 2) she developed coagulopathy and 3) she did not develop severe tissue necrosis at the bitten site.", "keywords": ["cobra", "Naja naja", "coagulopathy", "snake bites", "AVS"], "authors": [{"first_name": "RMMK Namal", "last_name": "Rathnayaka", "institution": "Provincial General Hospital,Ratnapura", "country": "LK", "email": "namalrath10@yahoo.com", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "SAM", "last_name": "Kularathna", "institution": "Faculty of Medicine-University of Pereadeniya", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "AGH", "last_name": "Sugathapala", "institution": "Provincial General Hospital, Ratnapura", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "PMCK", "last_name": "Pathiraja", "institution": "Provincial General Hospital, Ratnapura", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "PEAN", "last_name": "Ranathunga", "institution": "Provincial General Hospital, Ratnapura", "country": "LK", "email": "", "orcid": ""}], "section": "Case Reports", "pages": "89-90", "date_published": "2015-07-22T00:00:00+00:00", "date_submitted": "2015-03-31T03:35:16+00:00", "license_name": "", "license_link": "", "files": [{"label": "PDF", "language": "en", "url": "https://slja.sljol.info/articles/8069/files/8069-1-28708-1-10-20150722.pdf"}], "references": "", "volume": 23, "number": "2", "year": 2015, "issue_id": 731}